            "review_title": "Review at GangNam Bulgogi - AEON Mall Long Bien Restaurant",
            "review_text": "TIRAMESU\nHanoi, Vietnam1075 contributions\n0\nDirty, and lousy service, disgusting smell of lettuce\nJul 2016 • Family\nWe tried this Gangnam Bulgogi first time at Lotte Center Hanoi, the food is ok, staffs are extremely helpful and polite.\nHowever, this time we had lunch at Aeon Mall, this Gangnam Bulgogi was a disaster, everything was terrible from services to foods.\nThe set of lettuce, carrot, and some other vegetables to eat with grill meat is disgusting.\nThe lettuce full of rotting smell, just like foot odor ... urggg...\nWe checked with the staffs and you know what they said??? This season, that smell is normal but I asked them please try for themselves sniff the lecture and tell me what do they feel, all the staffs didn't dare to sniff ... WHY?\nAfter awhile, they've apologized and said those vegetable was not clean properly ... OMG. This is nightmare, so if you still want to eat here, smell everything, check everything before you actually put them in to your mouth.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 24, 2016",
